    <selectionEntry name="Contemptor Dreadnought" id="6f17-80a1-3077-aa2e" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <comment>Based on vehicle design rules and 7th edition stats

Walker-Normal
Points for Armour:
Front 13 = 20
Side 12 = 40
Rear 10 = 10

Normal = 10

Dreadnought CCW = 5*5*4 = 100
Combi-bolter = 6

Special Force Field = 35</comment>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Heavy Support" id="9740-2a88-33c4-9976" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="aacb-8a81-62c0-3db8"/>
      </categoryLinks>
